    "title": "Rates near 24-year highs",
    "text": "The 10-year yield touched 5.36% on Wednesday, its highest since 2002, as oil above $100 kept inflation worries alive. A strong auction calmed it, and it ended the week near 5.2%. Rate-sensitive small caps lagged."
