    "title": "AI trade tested",
    "text": "Thursday's OpenAI revenue report was the first real crack in this year's AI story. Chip names such as ARM, INTC, TER, SWKS and ON finished the week down 8-13%. Power producers tied to AI data centers, VST and CEG, rose about 15%."
   },
   {
    "title": "Defense over offense",
